<title>MALTA: Malta November unemployment rises to 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malta November unemployment rises to 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>November unemployment in Malta reached 4.1 percent, increasing by 430 from the previous month to 6,058, the Malta Statistics Centre said in its latest statement.</p>
<p>In November 1995, unemployment was 3.6 percent.</p>
<p>Job losses were mostly in private sector employment, especially in direct production, it said.</p>
</text>
